      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "• • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • • AI for Science expands to foundations and institutions \\ Anthropic • • • • • •",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re highlighting 20 scientific foundations, institutions, and research groups from around the world that we’ve partnered with in an expansion of our AI for Science program , which gives free Claude credits to researchers working on high-impact scientific projects.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We started the AI for Science program in May 2025 with the belief that AI could significantly speed up scientific progress.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "(Over the last few months, we’ve also launched our discounted Team plan for scientists and have supported hundreds of projects across biology, medicine, physics, chemistry, climate science, and mathematics.)",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AI for Science began by supporting individual scientists.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "By partnering with institutions and foundations, we’re now able to reach more researchers across many fields.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Founded in 1934, it supports original research and education in science, technology, engineering, mathematics, and economics.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Founded in 2024 by Eric and Wendy Schmidt, it works to accelerate scientific knowledge and breakthroughs with the most promising, advanced tools to support a thriving planet.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The organization prioritizes research in areas poised for impact, including AI and advanced computing, astrophysics, biosciences, climate, and space—and supports researchers in a variety of disciplines through its science systems program.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This $9 billion federal agency established by Congress in 1950 promotes the progress of science, advances national health and defense, and funds competitive research and education, accounting for about 25% of federal support for basic research at US colleges and universities.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Based in London, it’s one of Europe’s largest biomedical research institutes, with more than 100 research groups studying the biology behind health and disease.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As AI changes how science is done, our AI for Science program will continue to support and collaborate with scientists, institutions, and foundations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/ai-for-science-expands-foundations-research-institutions",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T01:46:16.292Z"
      }
